# MAGIC <tbody>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Managed connectors</strong> (Lakeflow Connect)</td>
# MAGIC <td>SaaS apps (Salesforce, Workday, ServiceNow…) and databases (SQL Server, PostgreSQL…). Fully managed, incremental, CDC-aware</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Standard connectors</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Files in cloud object storage (Auto Loader, <code>COPY INTO</code>, <code>read_files</code>) and message buses (Kafka, Kinesis…)</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Upload UI / Add data</strong></td>
