# MAGIC <td>Sources not covered natively, or a tool the company already uses</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Custom code</strong> (JDBC / REST in a notebook)</td>
# MAGIC <td>Anything else. You own pagination, retries and incrementality</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </tbody>
# MAGIC </table></div>
